# ==========================================
# DigiVahivat Monorepo .gitignore
# Covers: Backend (Express/Mongo), Web (Vite/React), App (React Native/Expo)
# ==========================================

# Dependencies across all workspaces
**/node_modules/
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Environment Variables & Secrets (Preserve .env.example)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
serviceAccountKey.json
*serviceAccount*.json

# Production Builds & Bundler Caches
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/web-build/
**/coverage/
.nyc_output

# Mobile Builds & Caches (Expo, Android, iOS)
**/.expo/
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
**/*.keystore
!debug.keystore
**/*.ipa
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
**/.xcode.env.local
**/.kotlin/
**/.cxx/

# Logs
**/logs/
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Uploads & Temporary Server Data
**/uploads/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.pid
**/*.pid.lock
**/*.seed

# OS & Editor Artifacts
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
